// Application icon (rasterized from app.svg -- see README).
// The resource is named GLFW_ICON because GLFW loads the running window /
// taskbar icon from a user resource of exactly that name; if it's missing GLFW
// falls back to the generic Windows icon. As the only icon group in the .exe it
// is also what Windows Explorer shows for the file.
GLFW_ICON ICON "app.ico"
